{"text":"<span>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I6-WlTWTG5c<br /><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13245.98278\">3:40:45</span> ### 1-7. Kusalattika-sappaccayadukaṃ ^7-51-0 </span><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span>##### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13253.92071\">3:40:53</span> 1. Kusalaṃ sappaccayaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo sappaccayo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Kusalaṃ sappaccayaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato sappaccayo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Kusalaṃ sappaccayaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo sappaccayo ca abyākato sappaccayo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-51-1</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13284.358284\">3:41:24</span> Akusalaṃ sappaccayaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo sappaccayo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13293.392289\">3:41:33</span> Abyākataṃ sappaccayaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato sappaccayo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13303.957202\">3:41:43</span> Kusalaṃ sappaccayañca abyākataṃ sappaccayañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato sappaccayo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13319.080488\">3:41:59</span> Akusalaṃ sappaccayañca abyākataṃ sappaccayañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato sappaccayo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13331.068495\">3:42:11</span> 2. Kusalaṃ sappaccayaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo sappaccayo dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) ^7-51-2 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13339.516248\">3:42:19</span> Akusalaṃ sappaccayaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo sappaccayo dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13349.037638\">3:42:29</span> Abyākataṃ sappaccayaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato sappaccayo dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13360.193409\">3:42:40</span> 3. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-51-3 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccanīyaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Nahetupaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13366.866855\">3:42:46</span> 4. Akusalaṃ sappaccayaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo sappaccayo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. (1) ^7-51-4 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13376.071142\">3:42:56</span> Abyākataṃ sappaccayaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato sappaccayo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13386.053912\">3:43:06</span> 5. Nahetuyā dve, naārammaṇe pañca, naadhipatiyā nava…pe… novigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-51-5 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13394.353062\">3:43:14</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe pañca (saṃkhittaṃ).\nNahetupaccayā ārammaṇe dve (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span>##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13407.275389\">3:43:27</span> 6. Kusalo sappaccayo dhammo kusalassa sappaccayassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-51-6 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13419.15376\">3:43:39</span> Akusalo sappaccayo dhammo akusalassa sappaccayassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13428.046762\">3:43:48</span> Abyākato sappaccayo dhammo abyākatassa sappaccayassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13437.173894\">3:43:57</span> 7. Kusalo sappaccayo dhammo kusalassa sappaccayassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-51-7 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13445.557106\">3:44:05</span> Akusalo sappaccayo dhammo akusalassa sappaccayassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13454.432615\">3:44:14</span> Abyākato sappaccayo dhammo abyākatassa sappaccayassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13464.921622\">3:44:24</span> 8. Hetuyā satta, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā dasa, anantare satta…pe… sahajāte nava…pe… upanissaye nava…pe… avigate terasa (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-51-8\n<br />Nahetuyā pannarasa, naārammaṇe pannarasa (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nHetupaccayā naārammaṇe satta (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span>#### 1-8. Kusalattika-saṅkhatadukaṃ ^7-51a-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-51b-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13483.837578\">3:44:43</span> 9. Kusalaṃ saṅkhataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo saṅkhato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (sappaccayadukasadisaṃ). ^7-51b-9 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-9. Kusalattika-sanidassanadukaṃ ^7-51c-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-51d-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</span></p><p><span><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13494.635404\">3:44:54</span> 10. Kusalaṃ anidassanaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo anidassano dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-51d-10 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13504.793342\">3:45:04</span> Akusalaṃ anidassanaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo anidassano dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13513.224741\">3:45:13</span> Abyākataṃ anidassanaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato anidassano dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13522.186595\">3:45:22</span> Kusalaṃ anidassanañca abyākataṃ anidassanañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato anidassano dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13534.469225\">3:45:34</span> Akusalaṃ anidassanañca abyākataṃ anidassanañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato anidassano dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13542.109384\">3:45:42</span> 11. Kusalaṃ anidassanaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo anidassano dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) ^7-51d-11 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13552.614285\">3:45:52</span> Akusalaṃ anidassanaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo anidassano dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13561.085457\">3:46:01</span> Abyākataṃ anidassanaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato anidassano dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13570.842668\">3:46:10</span> 12. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-51d-12</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccanīyaṃ –nahetupaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13576.155951\">3:46:16</span> 13. Akusalaṃ anidassanaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo anidassano dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. (1) ^7-51d-13 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13585.948939\">3:46:25</span> Abyākataṃ anidassanaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato anidassano dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13596.420932\">3:46:36</span> Nahetuyā dve, naārammaṇe pañca, naadhipatiyā nava…pe… novigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ). </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13610.808084\">3:46:50</span> 14. Kusalo anidassano dhammo kusalassa anidassanassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-51d-14 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13622.628562\">3:47:02</span> Akusalo anidassano dhammo akusalassa anidassanassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13632.058883\">3:47:12</span> Abyākato anidassano dhammo abyākatassa anidassanassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13641.499936\">3:47:21</span> 15. Kusalo anidassano dhammo kusalassa anidassanassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-51d-15 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13651.294965\">3:47:31</span> Akusalo anidassano dhammo akusalassa anidassanassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13661.534348\">3:47:41</span> Abyākato anidassano dhammo abyākatassa anidassanassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13673.21271\">3:47:53</span> 16. Hetuyā satta, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā dasa, anantare satta…pe… upanissaye nava…pe… avigate terasa (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-51d-16\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span>### 1-10. Kusalattika-sappaṭighadukaṃ ^7-51e-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-51f-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetupaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13689.92217\">3:48:09</span> 17. Abyākataṃ sappaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato sappaṭigho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-51f-17 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13703.256352\">3:48:23</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13712.132375\">3:48:32</span> 18. Kusalaṃ appaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo appaṭigho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-51f-18 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13722.32576\">3:48:42</span> Akusalaṃ appaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo appaṭigho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13731.633331\">3:48:51</span> Abyākataṃ appaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato appaṭigho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13741.534823\">3:49:01</span> Kusalaṃ appaṭighañca abyākataṃ appaṭighañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato appaṭigho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13752.632807\">3:49:12</span> Akusalaṃ appaṭighañca abyākataṃ appaṭighañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato appaṭigho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Ārammaṇapaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13764.275924\">3:49:24</span> 19. Kusalaṃ appaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo appaṭigho dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) ^7-51f-19 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13773.303948\">3:49:33</span> Akusalaṃ appaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo appaṭigho dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13785.862319\">3:49:45</span> Abyākataṃ appaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato appaṭigho dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)\n\n20. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-51f-20 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccanīyaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Nahetupaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13798.600555\">3:49:58</span> 21. Akusalaṃ appaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo appaṭigho dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. (1) ^7-51f-21 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13807.337525\">3:50:07</span> Abyākataṃ appaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato appaṭigho dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13817.542887\">3:50:17</span> 22. Nahetuyā dve, naārammaṇe pañca, naadhipatiyā nava…pe… novigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ). ^7-51f-22</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetupaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13831.91827\">3:50:31</span> 23. Kusalo appaṭigho dhammo kusalassa appaṭighassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-51f-23 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13841.057038\">3:50:41</span> Akusalo appaṭigho dhammo akusalassa appaṭighassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13850.227857\">3:50:50</span> Abyākato appaṭigho dhammo abyākatassa appaṭighassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13859.530205\">3:50:59</span> 24. Hetuyā satta, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā dasa…pe… avigate terasa (saṃkhittaṃ. Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-51f-24 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-11. Kusalattika-rūpīdukaṃ ^7-51g-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-51h-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetupaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13871.685714\">3:51:11</span><span> 25. Abyākataṃ rūpiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato rūpī dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-51h-25 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13884.992101\">3:51:24</span><span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13896.245227\">3:51:36</span><span> 26. Kusalaṃ arūpiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo arūpī dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-51h-26 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13904.265654\">3:51:44</span><span> Akusalaṃ arūpiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo arūpī dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13912.42954\">3:51:52</span><span> Abyākataṃ arūpiṃ dh</span><span>ammaṃ paṭicca abyākato arūpī dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13921.480284\">3:52:01</span><span> 27. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-51h-27 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13926.482036\">3:52:06</span><span> Nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā tīṇi…pe… (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ). </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13936.503494\">3:52:16</span><span> 28. Kusalo arūpī dhammo kusalassa arūpissa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-51h-28 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13944.570754\">3:52:24</span><span> Akusalo arūpī dhammo akusalassa arūpissa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13951.813786\">3:52:31</span><span> Abyākato arūpī dhammo abyākatassa arūpissa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13960.570574\">3:52:40</span><span> Kusalo arūpī dhammo kusalassa arūpissa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13969.449297\">3:52:49</span><span> Akusalo arūpī dhammo akusalassa arūpissa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13978.464129\">3:52:58</span><span> Abyākato arūpī dhammo abyākatassa arūpissa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13988.84602\">3:53:08</span><span> 29. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā satta…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-51h-29\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-12. Kusalattika-lokiyadukaṃ ^7-51i-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetupaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><